  "blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "block-000112-7c427d3a",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/p[6]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 112,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "9pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Competitors to Office include software and global application vendors, web-based and mobile application companies, AI-first application companies, as well as local application developers. We compete by providing secure, integrated industry-specific, and easy-to-use productivity and collaboration tools and services that create comprehensive solutions and work well with technologies our customers already have both on-premises or in the cloud.",
      "text_hash": "7c427d3a2300ee8affc8b7f6596f3dc6aeb3b0834b875526a3cd11c2011b0f47",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000113-bc876fa1",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/p[7]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 113,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "9pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Windows faces competition from various software products and from alternative platforms and devices. Microsoft Defender for Endpoint competes with endpoint security solution providers.",
      "text_hash": "bc876fa1bdf9d1e2574a55ca6681b8188df845a8f87429eb53dabf9602aaeb17",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000114-0cdf0fbd",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/p[8]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 114,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "9pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Our Enterprise Mobility + Security offerings compete with products from a range of competitors including identity vendors, security solution vendors, and numerous other security point solution vendors.",
      "text_hash": "0cdf0fbdbad223360d5182e757085d57a0b94daf68a9422519718b92b4b772c4",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000115-aeccb0a6",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/p[9]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 115,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "9pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "LinkedIn faces competition from online professional networks; recruiting, talent management, and human resource services companies; job boards; companies that provide learning and development products and services; online and offline outlets that generate revenue from advertisers and marketers; and online and offline outlets for companies with lead generation and customer intelligence and insights.",
      "text_hash": "aeccb0a6d850778a9f4a597c8c38c71167078b3fca6358401f70f69a7f3a9e63",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000116-338416e5",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/p[10]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 116,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "9pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Dynamics competes with cloud-based and on-premises business solution providers.",
      "text_hash": "338416e5bbc2e40c9e7ff2dba2994e20f0288bde8ed901676cbde8755dffd8f6",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000117-925ee601",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/p[11]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 117,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "font-weight",
          "bold"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "13.5pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "left"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Intelligent Cloud",
      "text_hash": "925ee6010a3a345fe7254c4a0afd9d3d6ee895065adf6733491fdfc7ea81b29e",
      "type": "heading_candidate"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000118-5e917062",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/p[12]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 118,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "9pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Our Intelligent Cloud segment consists of our public, private, and hybrid server products and cloud services that power modern business and developers. This segment primarily comprises:",
      "text_hash": "5e917062d98a0c16faaba740b5332ca48d66d29ec417085265ec93005789e273",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000119-4f8865ab",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/div[1]/span",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 119,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "•",
      "text_hash": "4f8865abeddbfab37520d0c56eed1bf17f37e3778e1a55e6dc54895d2ae17849",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000120-c34f7245",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/div[1]/div",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 120,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "arial"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Server products and cloud services, including Azure and other cloud services, comprising cloud and AI consumption-based services, GitHub cloud services, Nuance Healthcare cloud services, virtual desktop offerings, and other cloud services; and Server products, comprising SQL Server, Windows Server, Visual Studio, System Center, related Client Access Licenses (“CALs”), and other on-premises offerings.",
      "text_hash": "c34f7245fa9e88e6ae478ced0a0998fbba3c5cdfbf20ee4c78ae1a0d47c747bb",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000121-4f8865ab",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/div[2]/span",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 121,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "•",
      "text_hash": "4f8865abeddbfab37520d0c56eed1bf17f37e3778e1a55e6dc54895d2ae17849",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000122-c07a987e",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[18]/div[2]/div",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 122,
      "reported_page": 6,
      "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "arial"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Enterprise and partner services, including Enterprise Support Services, Industry Solutions, Nuance professional services, Microsoft Partner Network, and Learning Experience.",
      "text_hash": "c07a987eb7f09b3a5158f3aa698c357965655a36d0d8f79f9559316e17d1a1cc",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
